The local machine and process baselines adapt the Voron presets in
PancakeSlicer's engine/resources/profiles/Voron. The Micron+ profile uses
the PRINT_START and PRINT_END macros and motion limits from the official
Klipper template.
The printable area uses the 180 mm build's X limit of 173 mm and the nominal
180 mm bed depth within the 190 mm Y travel. The 165 mm print height is the
template's Z travel limit. The firmware template limits the hotend to 300 C
and the bed to 120 C.

